    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="19">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 19</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="19" corresp="#wit-b">[19] Be wudewarde. Wuduwearde gebyreð ælc windfylled treow.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="19" corresp="#wit-q">Ƿudeƿeard (id est custodi nemoris uel forestario) iure cedit lignum omne uento deiectum.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#gobbitt" n="20" corresp="#wit-b">Be wudewarde . Wuduwearde gebyreð ælc wind fylled treow .</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-b"><hi rend="italic">Be wudewarde</hi> Wuduwearde gebyreð ælc windfylled treow.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#gobbitt" corresp="#wit-b">Concerning the forester To the forester is due each wind-felled tree.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-b"><hi rend="italic">Regarding the Forester</hi> To the forester is due every tree felled by the wind.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Vom Waldwart. Dem Waldwart gebührt jeder vom Wind gefällte Baum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">Of the woodward. To the woodward is due every tree blown down by the wind.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
